messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 99 and 99?', "<think>\nTo find the product of 99 and 99, I can use the standard multiplication method.\n\nFirst, I'll multiply 99 by 90, which gives me 8910.\n\nNext, I'll multiply 99 by 9, resulting in 891.\n\nFinally, I'll add these two results together: 8910 plus 891 equals 9801.\n\nTherefore, the product of 99 and 99 is 9801.\n</think>.\n\nTo find the product of 99 and 99, we can use the standard multiplication method. Here's a step-by-step solution:.\n\n\\[.\n\\begin{align*}.\n99 \\times 99 &= (100 - 1) \\times (100 - 1) \\\\.\n&= 100 \\times 100 - 100 \\times 1 - 1 \\times 100 + 1 \\times 1 \\\\.\n&= 10,\\!000 - 100 - 100 + 1 \\\\.\n&= 10,\\!000 - 200 + 1 \\\\.\n&= 9,\\!800 + 1 \\\\.\n&= 9,\\!801.\n\\end{align*}.\n\\].Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
