messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 38 and 90?', "<think>\nTo find the product of 38 and 90, I can break down the multiplication into simpler steps.\n\nFirst, I'll multiply 38 by 90. To make this easier, I can separate 90 into 9 times 10.\n\nSo, 38 multiplied by 9 is 342. Then, multiplying 342 by 10 gives me 3,420.\n\nTherefore, the product of 38 and 90 is 3,420.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **38** and **90**, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Multiply 38 by 90:**\n   \n   \\[\n   38 \\times 90\n   \\]\n\n2. **Break down the multiplication for simplicity:**\n   \n   \\[\n   38 \\times 90 = 38 \\times (9 \\times 10) = (38 \\times 9) \\times 10\n   \\]\n\n3. **Calculate \\(38 \\times 9\\):**\n   \n   \\[\n   38 \\times 9 = 342\n   \\]\n\n4. **Multiply the result by 10:**\n   \n   \\[\n   342 \\times 10 = 3,\\!420\n   \\]\n\n5. **Final Answer:**\n   \n   \\[\n   \\boxed{3,\\!420}\n   \\].Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
